From 15983dcd2eb0db5ae53e862f77ee192b821917b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 02:21:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] M2-HER-1103 (FAST-TRACK): battle stand-ins for Rhen, Asha and
 Toma use hero-integration's battle actors

battle_sandbox.json stand_ins scene -> game/hero_motion/battle/<hero>_battle_actor.tscn, as agreed
with hero-integration (docs/kb/tech/hero_battle_proposed.patch; its set_ko and test hunks are in big9).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KGBUwbYgXe9JS6D8jXw6ZG
---
 game/data/ui/battle_sandbox.json | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/game/data/ui/battle_sandbox.json b/game/data/ui/battle_sandbox.json
index 7c11fe50..99e99b52 100644
--- a/game/data/ui/battle_sandbox.json
+++ b/game/data/ui/battle_sandbox.json
@@ -16,11 +16,11 @@
     "shake": {"amplitude_m": 0.05, "sec": 0.24, "steps": 6},
     "stand_ins": {
